<Base title="About — Anvi Innovate" description="Anvi Innovate is an AI/ML talent company: we train and deploy fresh AI, ML and GenAI talent to teams building real AI products.">
  <span class="pill">About</span>
  <h1>The skilled human layer behind AI</h1>
  <div style="max-width:760px;">
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:1.1rem;">
      Anvi Innovate is a resource-centric AI/ML talent company. We train people in modern AI and Generative AI, screen them for aptitude, and deploy deployment-ready talent to teams building real AI products.
    </p>
    <h2>The model</h2>
    <p class="muted">Clients tell us their demand; we supply trained, ready resources — contract staffing, contract-to-hire, or hire-train-deploy. Candidates create a profile, get matched to projects, and grow their careers, with training and certification through our partner bxup.in.</p>
    <h2>The market gap</h2>
    <p class="muted">The global AI training dataset market is projected to reach <strong>USD 8.60 billion by 2030</strong> at a <strong>21.9% CAGR</strong> (Grand View Research). The bottleneck isn't compute — it's skilled, reliable people. That's what we build and deploy.</p>
    <p class="muted">In collaboration with <strong><a href="https://bxup.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">bxup.in</a></strong>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
